bds 4,5 "Meteorological hazard report"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Meteorological hazard report: turbulence, wind shear, microburst,
    icing, wake vortex, temperature, pressure and radio height.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-32.

items

    TURB_STATUS "Turbulence Status"
        definition
            Validity of the turbulence level.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    TURB "Turbulence Level"
        definition
            Turbulence level.
        element 2
            table
                0: None
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    WS_STATUS "Wind Shear Status"
        definition
            Validity of the wind shear level.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    WS "Wind Shear Level"
        definition
            Wind shear level.
        element 2
            table
                0: None
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    MB_STATUS "Microburst Status"
        definition
            Validity of the microburst level.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    MB "Microburst Level"
        definition
            Microburst level.
        element 2
            table
                0: None
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    ICING_STATUS "Icing Status"
        definition
            Validity of the icing level.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    ICING "Icing Level"
        definition
            Icing level.
        element 2
            table
                0: None
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    WV_STATUS "Wake Vortex Status"
        definition
            Validity of the wake vortex level.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    WV "Wake Vortex Level"
        definition
            Wake vortex encounter level.
        element 2
            table
                0: None
                1: Light
                2: Moderate
                3: Severe

    SAT_STATUS "Static Air Temperature Status"
        definition
            Validity of the static air temperature value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    SAT_SIGN "Static Air Temperature Sign"
        definition
            Sign of the static air temperature magnitude.
        element 1
            table
                0: Positive
                1: Negative
        remark
            Combined with SAT into a single signed value.

    SAT "Static Air Temperature Magnitude"
        definition
            Magnitude of the static air temperature.
        element 9
            unsigned quantity 1/4 "°C"
        remark
            Combined with SAT_SIGN into a single signed value.

    PRESS_STATUS "Static Pressure Status"
        definition
            Validity of the static pressure value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    PRESS "Static Pressure"
        definition
            Average static pressure.
        element 11
            unsigned quantity 1 "hPa"

    RH_STATUS "Radio Height Status"
        definition
            Validity of the radio height value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    RADIO_HEIGHT "Radio Height"
        definition
            Radio (radar) height above terrain.
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 16 "ft"

    spare 5
